1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,530
Na aula de hoje

2
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,550
você vai aprender

3
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,530
a fazer o drop set.

4
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:02,700
Como que a gente

5
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,000
faz o drop set?

6
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,190
Primeiro, você vai colocar

7
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:05,950
o peso na máquina

8
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,250
o máximo que você aguenta.

9
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:07,850
Por exemplo,

10
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,150
vamos supor que eu

11
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:09,990
aguente 50 quilos,

12
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:10,950
eu vou botar na máquina

13
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:11,900
50 quilos.

14
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:12,600
Agora eu vou fazer

15
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,700
10 repetições.

16
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:17,750
Normal,

17
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:18,900
sobe com força

18
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,200
e volta devagar,

19
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,300
sem correr.

20
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,060
Fiz as 10 repetições,

21
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,300
sem descansar,

22
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:27,950
eu vou abaixar

23
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:29,330
10 quilos na máquina,

24
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,120
ou seja,

25
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,200
eu vou botar 40.

26
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,540
Faço novamente mais 10.

27
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:34,960
Lembre-se,

28
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,000
sem descansar.

29
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:40,600
Mesma coisa,

30
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:42,100
sobe com força,

31
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:43,900
volta devagar sem correr,

32
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:45,700
concentrado.

33
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,880
Fiz as 10,

34
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,500
vou abaixar novamente para 30.

35
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,600
Faço novamente mais 10.

36
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,950
Agora sim, acabei,

37
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:01,770
eu vou descansar

38
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:01,883
1 minuto.

39
00:01:01,933 --> 00:01:02,883
Isso foi uma série

40
00:01:02,883 --> 00:01:03,817
de drop set.

41
00:01:03,867 --> 00:01:04,457
Se sua ficha

42
00:01:04,457 --> 00:01:05,307
tiver escrito

43
00:01:05,307 --> 00:01:06,937
"drop set 3 séries",

44
00:01:06,937 --> 00:01:07,387
você vai fazer

45
00:01:07,387 --> 00:01:08,657
todo esse processo

46
00:01:08,657 --> 00:01:09,600
3 vezes.
